k stating that any  player who resides in Japan needs to  have a je su license to receive their  prize money and while that might fly for  tournaments to take place in Japan that  doesn't make any sense returns to take  place in any other part of the world  that's messed up  Toula Japan's wild gambling laws prevent  players from earning their prize money  anywhere else in the world if a Moche  wins capcom cup he deserves his money  thanks for watching if you want more  content like this hit the sub button and  ring that notification bell for unique  bite-sized videos you won't find  anywhere else  hit up our Instagram Twitter and  Facebook pages  [Music]
 

